# Studio and playback interaction responsiveness

Status: DONE
Milestone: Responsive native Studio controls
Dependencies: 24_REPLAY_TIMELINE.todo

## Purpose
Remove measured UI-thread stalls, especially while dragging the replay timeline, without
changing tracking, frame selection, clean-output pixels or privacy boundaries.

## Tasks
- [x] Profile the imported-avatar redraw path.
- [x] Measure queued native-window Tk-event latency before and after the fix.
- [x] Move heavy drawing off Tk, yield between image updates and cache static mesh work.
- [x] Cover redraw scheduling, visibility equivalence and source/lifecycle behavior.
- [x] Update documentation, evidence, journal and current-base continuity.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Native-window queued drag events have recorded latency and improved responsiveness.
- [x] One drag still commits one seek on release, never per pointer movement.
- [x] Main/clean/debug redraws do not form one long UI callback.
- [x] Static mesh caching preserves exact visibility and synthetic rendering.
- [x] Errors, shutdown and stale/private-input clearing remain explicit.
- [x] Focused tests, Ruff and affected native checks pass with retained failure evidence.

## Completion evidence
- Before-fix imported-avatar profiling with authored observations measured two-view median
  111.51ms, p95 153.08ms under cProfile. This is not an uninstrumented performance guarantee.
- Profile: .local\ui-responsiveness\before\render-profile.txt.
- Queued-event p95 paused/playing:127.23/131.85ms before,18.25/20.74ms completed,
  14.89/18.48ms repeat. All80positions per phase delivered; one seek per drag.
-312full-suite cases pass; native Studio/model/motion/debug groups19/9/10/9 and timeline7/8pass.
  Eight authored before/after studio/clean images match exactly. No sensing-accuracy claim.
- GraphicsWorker owns renderer mutations and OpenGL; Tk independently revokes stale displays.
  Raw input stays separate. Source/model/profile unchanged, no live camera or publication.
- Handbook82pages/179citations. Scoped receipt:docs\evidence\studio-responsiveness-validation.json.
- Retained cooperative-only/avatar-only performance failures and one concurrent-book timing-test
  failure. Serial full-suite and two final latency runs pass; no safety deadline was weakened.

## Completion log
- 2026-10-13 - Owner reported laggy UI, especially during timeline dragging; investigation started.
- 2026-10-13 - Single-owner background graphics, stale-display safeguards and measured fix completed.
